review_basis = "All 33 source members read in full against package requirements and registry contracts. Expanded the truncated 400-entry package produces list to all 1528 member-owned registry rows, and reviewed the 96 consumed rows against actual SDK/runtime/hosted crossings. Lexical cross-domain error-name matches are not runtime dependencies. No retired router, daemon, checkpoint-finality authority or mirror-as-RPC dependency was found in this slice."
