observed = "The guest entrypoint is packaged by Makefile:2915 with cargo build --release for wasm32-unknown-unknown, but programs/Cargo.toml:31 sets release opt-level=3 and the command has no z override. The declared build profile disagrees with the brief. This static audit does not establish emitted Wasm size or claim a payload-size gate ran."
